atibility) - ANGLE (Intel, Intel(R) UHD Graphics (0x00004E55) Direct3D11 vs_5_0 ps_5_0, D3D11-31.0.101.1999) - Intel(R) Celeron(R) N5095 @ 2.00GHz (4 threads) - 15.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n@export_category fails to show up when using it in Nested instances, such as in an Array, or inside of another Node's @export.\nThe category will show up when selecting the Resource that contains it when in the Inspector, but it doesn't show up in Nested instances.\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"231\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5372101-a201-462e-ad61-0b1359cf624b\" />\n\n@export_group and @export_subgroup both function correctly, however.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a Node.\nAdd a script with an @export for a custom Resource.\nCreate a new Resource in the FileSystem.\nAdd a script to that Resource as follows:\n\n```\nextends Resource\nclass_name CustomResource\n\n@export var placeholder : int = 164\n@export_category('category')\n@export var lorem_ipsum : String = 'words'\n```\nAdd the custom Resource to the node, and the category fails to appear.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[resource-export-category-bug-MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25157718/resource-export-category-bug-MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rep